Audited 79 actual seeded-base, normalization, derivative-bound and time-integration theorem declarations; only the permitted three axioms.
The terminal seeded derivative and comparison bounds assume only the genuine bounded independent data, actual signed relative third and both fourth matrices, unit marginal variances and bandwidth condition. The signed cubic aggregate and copy-dependent fourth shifts retain their actual laws; no analytic oracle is supplied.
